#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: post-branch.php
msgid "WP Branches For Post"
msgstr "WP Branches For Post"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: post-branch.php
msgid "https://github.com/hsxk/WP-Branches-For-Post/"
msgstr "https://github.com/hsxk/WP-Branches-For-Post/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: post-branch.php
msgid ""
"Create safe working branches for published WordPress content and merge them "
"back without changing the public post while editing."
msgstr ""
"为已发布的 WordPress 内容创建安全的工作分支，在编辑期间保持公开文章不变，完成"
"后再将更改合并回原始文章。"

#. Author of the plugin
#: post-branch.php
msgid "Hao Kexin"
msgstr "Hao Kexin"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: post-branch.php
msgid "https://time2log.com/about/"
msgstr "https://time2log.com/about/"

#: includes/class-admin.php:92 build/index.js:8 src/index.js:684
msgid "Review changes"
msgstr "检查更改"

#: includes/class-admin.php:98
msgid "Merge branch"
msgstr "合并分支"

#: includes/class-admin.php:109 includes/class-admin.php:190 build/index.js:6
#: src/index.js:408
msgid "Create branch"
msgstr "创建分支"

#. translators: %d: original post ID.
#: includes/class-admin.php:126
#, php-format
msgid "Branch of #%d"
msgstr "#%d 的分支"

#: includes/class-admin.php:153 includes/class-admin.php:175
#: includes/class-admin.php:188 build/index.js:8 src/index.js:763
msgid "Post Branch"
msgstr "文章分支"

#: includes/class-admin.php:154 build/index.js:6 src/index.js:575
msgid "The original post is unavailable. This branch cannot be merged."
msgstr "原始文章不可用，无法合并此分支。"

#: includes/class-admin.php:166 includes/class-admin.php:265
msgid ""
"The original changed after this branch was created. This action will force "
"the merge and prefer branch values where changes overlap. Continue only "
"after reviewing both versions."
msgstr ""
"创建此分支后原始文章已发生变化。此操作将强制合并，并在重叠更改处优先采用分支"
"值。请检查两个版本后再继续。"

#: includes/class-admin.php:178
msgid "Force merge after review"
msgstr "检查后强制合并"

#: includes/class-admin.php:178
msgid "Merge into original"
msgstr "合并到原始文章"

#: includes/class-admin.php:223
msgid "Create Branch"
msgstr "创建分支"

#. translators: 1: original post ID, 2: edit URL for the original post.
#: includes/class-admin.php:255
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This is a working branch of post #%1$d. The public original stays unchanged "
"until you explicitly merge this branch. <a href=\"%2$s\">Open original</a>."
msgstr ""
"这是文章 #%1$d 的工作分支。在你明确合并此分支之前，公开的原始文章不会发生变"
"化。<a href=\"%2$s\">打开原始文章</a>。"

#: includes/class-admin.php:267
msgid "WP Branches For Post could not complete the requested operation."
msgstr "WP Branches For Post 无法完成请求的操作。"

#: includes/class-branch-service.php:104
msgid "You cannot create a branch for this post."
msgstr "无法为这篇文章创建分支。"

#: includes/class-branch-service.php:113
msgid "The original post does not exist."
msgstr "原始文章不存在。"

#: includes/class-branch-service.php:123
msgid "The original post could not be snapshotted."
msgstr "无法为原始文章创建基准快照。"

#: includes/class-branch-service.php:169
msgid ""
"The original changed while the branch was being created. Please try again so "
"the branch starts from a consistent version."
msgstr "创建分支期间原始文章发生了变化。请重试，以确保分支从一致的版本开始。"

#: includes/class-branch-service.php:181
msgid "The branch relationship metadata could not be stored."
msgstr "无法保存分支关系元数据。"

#: includes/class-branch-service.php:326 includes/class-merge-service.php:235
msgid "This post is not an active branch."
msgstr "这篇文章不是活动分支。"

#: includes/class-branch-service.php:332
msgid "The original post is unavailable."
msgstr "原始文章不可用。"

#: includes/class-branch-service.php:336
msgid "You do not have permission to update this branch."
msgstr "你没有权限更新这个分支。"

#: includes/class-branch-service.php:341
msgid "This older branch cannot be automatically updated from the original."
msgstr "无法自动从原始文章更新这个旧版分支。"

#: includes/class-branch-service.php:356
msgid ""
"The branch could not be snapshotted before updating it from the original."
msgstr "从原始文章更新分支前，无法为分支创建快照。"

#: includes/class-branch-service.php:376 includes/class-branch-service.php:431
msgid ""
"The branch or original changed while the branch was being updated. Review "
"the latest changes and try again."
msgstr "更新分支期间，分支或原始文章发生了变化。请检查最新更改后重试。"

#: includes/class-branch-service.php:387 includes/class-branch-service.php:420
#: includes/class-branch-service.php:443
msgid ""
"Updating the branch failed and its previous state could not be fully "
"restored automatically."
msgstr "更新分支失败，并且无法自动完整恢复其先前状态。"

#: includes/class-branch-service.php:398
msgid "The branch could not be updated. Its previous state was restored."
msgstr "无法更新分支，已恢复到更新前的状态。"

#: includes/class-branch-service.php:455
msgid ""
"The branch baseline could not be updated. Its previous state was restored."
msgstr "无法更新分支基准信息。已恢复之前的状态。"

#: includes/class-branch-service.php:542 includes/class-branch-service.php:576
msgid "The branch baseline snapshot could not be stored."
msgstr "无法保存分支基准快照。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:59
msgid "You do not have permission to force this merge."
msgstr "你没有权限强制执行此次合并。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:108
msgid "The branch or original could not be snapshotted before merging."
msgstr "合并前无法为分支或原始文章创建快照。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:132 includes/class-rest-controller.php:224
msgid "The review state changed. Review the latest changes before merging."
msgstr "审阅状态已发生变化。合并前请重新检查最新更改。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:147
msgid ""
"The merge failed and the original could not be fully restored automatically."
msgstr "合并失败，并且无法自动完整恢复原始文章。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:157
msgid ""
"The merge could not be completed. The original post was restored to its pre-"
"merge state."
msgstr "无法完成合并，原始文章已恢复到合并前的状态。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:172
msgid ""
"The merge was applied, the branch could not be moved to Trash, and the "
"original could not be fully restored automatically."
msgstr "合并已应用，但无法将分支移至回收站，并且无法自动完整恢复原始文章。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:182
msgid ""
"The branch could not be moved to Trash, so the original post was restored "
"and the branch remains active."
msgstr "无法将分支移至回收站，因此已恢复原始文章，分支仍保持有效。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:210
msgid "This post is not a branch."
msgstr "这篇文章不是分支。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:214
msgid "You do not have permission to discard this branch."
msgstr "你没有权限放弃这个分支。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:219
msgid "The branch could not be moved to Trash."
msgstr "无法将该分支移到回收站。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:240
msgid "The branch relationship changed before the merge could be applied."
msgstr "应用合并前，分支关联关系发生了变化。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:245
msgid "The original post no longer exists."
msgstr "原始文章已不存在。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:248
msgid "The branch and original no longer use the same post type."
msgstr "分支与原始文章已不再使用相同的文章类型。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:251
msgid "You do not have permission to merge this branch."
msgstr "你没有权限合并这个分支。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:270
msgid ""
"This older branch has no three-way baseline. Review the original before "
"forcing the merge."
msgstr "这个旧版分支没有三方比较基准。强制合并前请检查原始文章。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:272
msgid "The original post is unavailable, so this branch cannot be merged."
msgstr "原始文章不可用，因此无法合并此分支。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:274
msgid ""
"The branch and original contain overlapping changes. Review the detected "
"conflicts before forcing the merge."
msgstr "分支与原始文章包含重叠更改。强制合并前请检查检测到的冲突。"

#: includes/class-sync-service.php:162
msgid "A post metadata value could not be synchronized."
msgstr "无法同步某个文章元数据值。"

#: includes/class-sync-service.php:172
msgid "Post metadata synchronization could not be verified."
msgstr "无法验证文章元数据同步结果。"

#: includes/class-sync-service.php:258
msgid "Taxonomy synchronization could not be verified."
msgstr "无法验证分类法同步结果。"

#: includes/class-sync-service.php:493 includes/class-sync-service.php:520
msgid ""
"The branch and original contain overlapping changes that require review."
msgstr "分支与原始文章包含重叠更改，需要检查。"

#: includes/class-sync-service.php:546
msgid "The saved branch snapshot is invalid."
msgstr "保存的分支快照无效。"

#: includes/class-sync-service.php:591
msgid "The merged post state could not be verified."
msgstr "无法验证合并后的文章状态。"

