#. translators: %s: post meta key.
#: build/index.js:2 src/index.js:46
msgid "Metadata: %s"
msgstr "元数据：%s"

#. translators: %s: taxonomy slug.
#: build/index.js:3 src/index.js:53
msgid "Taxonomy: %s"
msgstr "分类法：%s"

#: build/index.js:3 src/index.js:118
msgid "Three-way comparison"
msgstr "三方比较"

#: build/index.js:3 src/index.js:128
msgid "Base"
msgstr "基准版本"

#: build/index.js:3 src/index.js:137
msgid "Original now"
msgstr "原始文章当前值"

#: build/index.js:3 src/index.js:147
msgid "Branch now"
msgstr "分支当前值"

#: build/index.js:3 src/index.js:209
msgid ""
"Save or discard the current edits to the original before creating a branch. "
"This prevents unpublished editor changes from being mistaken for the branch "
"baseline."
msgstr ""
"创建分支前，请先保存或放弃原始文章当前未保存的编辑，避免把未发布的编辑误认为"
"分支基准。"

#: build/index.js:3 src/index.js:287
msgid ""
"The review state changed after saving. Review the latest conflicts before "
"merging."
msgstr "保存后检查状态发生了变化。合并前请检查最新冲突。"

#. translators: %d: branch post ID.
#: build/index.js:4 src/index.js:341
msgid "Branch #%d"
msgstr "分支 #%d"

#. translators: %s: branch creator display name.
#: build/index.js:5 build/index.js:7 src/index.js:359 src/index.js:610
msgid "Created by %s"
msgstr "创建者：%s"

#. translators: 1: number of branch changes, 2: number of conflicts.
#: build/index.js:6 src/index.js:368
msgid "%1$d branch changes · %2$d conflicts"
msgstr "%1$d 项分支更改 · %2$d 项冲突"

#: build/index.js:6 src/index.js:384
msgid ""
"Edit safely in a separate draft. The published post stays unchanged until "
"you merge the branch."
msgstr "可在独立草稿中安全编辑；在合并分支之前，已发布的文章不会发生变化。"

#: build/index.js:6 src/index.js:393
msgid ""
"This original has unsaved editor changes. Save or discard them before "
"creating a branch so the baseline matches the saved public post."
msgstr ""
"原始文章存在未保存的编辑。创建分支前请保存或放弃这些更改，使基准与已保存的公"
"开文章一致。"

#: build/index.js:6 src/index.js:407
msgid "Creating…"
msgstr "正在创建…"

#: build/index.js:6 src/index.js:417
msgid "Existing branches"
msgstr "现有分支"

#: build/index.js:6 src/index.js:441
msgid "Merge review"
msgstr "合并检查"

#: build/index.js:6 src/index.js:447
msgid ""
"This branch predates three-way snapshots, so detailed change comparison is "
"unavailable. Force merge only after manually reviewing the original."
msgstr ""
"此分支创建于三方快照功能之前，因此无法提供详细更改比较。请手动检查原始文章后"
"再强制合并。"

#: build/index.js:6 src/index.js:453
msgid "Branch changes"
msgstr "分支更改"

#: build/index.js:6 src/index.js:457
msgid "Original changes since branch creation"
msgstr "创建分支后原始文章的更改"

#: build/index.js:6 src/index.js:464
msgid "Conflicts"
msgstr "冲突"

#: build/index.js:6 src/index.js:469
msgid "Original identity changes preserved by merge"
msgstr "合并时保留的原始文章标识更改"

#: build/index.js:6 src/index.js:481
msgid "No mergeable branch changes are currently detected."
msgstr "当前未检测到可合并的分支更改。"

#: build/index.js:6 src/index.js:500 src/index.js:522
msgid "Saving and merging…"
msgstr "正在保存并合并…"

#: build/index.js:6 src/index.js:504
msgid "Save & merge into original"
msgstr "保存并合并到原始文章"

#: build/index.js:6 src/index.js:526
msgid "Force merge reviewed conflicts"
msgstr "强制合并已检查的冲突"

#: build/index.js:6 src/index.js:539
msgid ""
"The original has newer, non-conflicting changes. You can update this branch "
"first, or review and merge while preserving those original changes."
msgstr ""
"原始文章有较新的非冲突更改。你可以先用原始文章更新分支，也可以检查后直接合并"
"并保留这些原始更改。"

#: build/index.js:6 src/index.js:548
msgid ""
"The original identity changed (for example status, slug, author, or parent). "
"Those changes are preserved and are not overwritten by this branch."
msgstr ""
"原始文章的标识信息发生了变化（例如状态、别名、作者或父级）。这些更改会被保"
"留，不会被此分支覆盖。"

#: build/index.js:6 src/index.js:557
msgid ""
"The branch and original changed the same data differently. Review the "
"conflicts before deciding whether to force merge."
msgstr ""
"分支和原始文章对同一数据做了不同修改。请先检查冲突，再决定是否强制合并。"

#: build/index.js:6 src/index.js:566
msgid ""
"This older branch cannot provide a precise three-way comparison. Review the "
"original manually before forcing a merge."
msgstr "这个旧版分支无法提供精确的三方比较。强制合并前请手动检查原始文章。"

#: build/index.js:6 src/index.js:588
msgid "This draft is isolated from the public original."
msgstr "此草稿与公开的原始文章相互独立。"

#: build/index.js:6 src/index.js:600
msgid "Open original"
msgstr "打开原始文章"

#. translators: %d: number of synced patterns referenced by the branch.
#: build/index.js:8 src/index.js:625
msgid ""
"This branch references %d synced pattern(s). Editing a synced pattern is "
"global in WordPress and is not isolated by the branch."
msgstr ""
"此分支引用了 %d 个同步区块样板。编辑同步样板会全局影响 WordPress，并不会被分"
"支隔离。"

#: build/index.js:8 src/index.js:644
msgid "Preview branch"
msgstr "预览分支"

#: build/index.js:8 src/index.js:654
msgid "View original"
msgstr "查看原始文章"

#: build/index.js:8 src/index.js:666
msgid "Updating…"
msgstr "正在更新…"

#: build/index.js:8 src/index.js:667
msgid "Update branch from original"
msgstr "从原始文章更新分支"

#: build/index.js:8 src/index.js:683
msgid "Hide merge review"
msgstr "隐藏合并检查"

#: build/index.js:8 src/index.js:695
msgid "Discard branch"
msgstr "放弃分支"

#: build/index.js:8 src/index.js:709
msgid "Force merge conflicts?"
msgstr "强制合并冲突吗？"

#: build/index.js:8 src/index.js:710
msgid "Discard this branch?"
msgstr "放弃这个分支吗？"

#: build/index.js:8 src/index.js:717
msgid ""
"Force merge will prefer branch values for the listed conflicts. Non-"
"conflicting newer work on the original is still preserved."
msgstr ""
"强制合并会对列出的冲突优先采用分支值；原始文章中不冲突的较新更改仍会保留。"

#: build/index.js:8 src/index.js:721
msgid ""
"The branch will be moved to Trash. The public original will not be changed."
msgstr "分支将被移到回收站，公开的原始文章不会发生变化。"

#: build/index.js:8 src/index.js:735
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

#: build/index.js:8 src/index.js:753
msgid "Force merge"
msgstr "强制合并"

#: build/index.js:8 src/index.js:754
msgid "Move to Trash"
msgstr "移到回收站"
